Photorealistic cyberpunk user-interface asset: one single round transport push button, viewed perfectly straight-on, centered, filling about 70 percent of the image, isolated on a pure flat black background. Outer ring: dark carbon fibre and anodised gunmetal with fine machined notches. Just inside it, a continuous ring of electric cyan neon light, with four tiny hot magenta accent lights at the top, bottom, left and right. Face: completely blank glossy black glass, slightly domed, with one soft curved reflection and a very faint hexagon pattern under the glass. Blade Runner mood, product photography, crisp focus, perfectly circular and symmetrical. Absolutely no symbol, no icon, no arrow, no text, no letters. One object only, no watermark.
